    "name": "Phear",
    "steam_appid": 2879360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/e16e28e6ee276ab267ea6cf5f11816cf.avif?t=1732898183\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>Dare to step into the chilling unknown with Phear, where you and up to 3 companions will delve into sinister, haunted locales in search of evidence of the lurking entity. Amidst the unnerving and spine-tingling atmosphere, your survival instincts will be put to the ultimate test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/f88c4dc51f482516e0c72620e2b5273a.webp?t=1732898183\" width=223 height=36 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customize</strong>: Tailor your investigation experience by personalizing your character to your liking.<br></li><li><strong>Choose</strong>: Select your preferred map and difficulty level, ranging from beginner-friendly homes to harrowing professional settings like the eerie hospital.<br></li><li><strong>Immerse</strong>: Immerse yourself with our maps, tailored to your experience.<br></li><li><strong>Equip</strong>: Arm yourself with essential yet time-tested equipment to aid in your paranormal pursuits.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/928439a2f3525d30f22de3034e26ecad.webp?t=1732898183\" width=210 height=36 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Single-player</strong>: Play by yourself and to your own accord with a more challenging experience.<br></li><li><strong>Co-op</strong>: Cooperate with your friends or new investigators, for the best horror experience.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/ca78f1a5fd0fbb2bef6de9a7d4c924d7.webp?t=1732898183\" width=211 height=36 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Beware!</strong> Entities are keen listeners and great care should be taken with every word.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/e16e28e6ee276ab267ea6cf5f11816cf.avif?t=1732898183\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>Dare to step into the chilling unknown with Phear, where you and up to 3 companions will delve into sinister, haunted locales in search of evidence of the lurking entity. Amidst the unnerving and spine-tingling atmosphere, your survival instincts will be put to the ultimate test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/f88c4dc51f482516e0c72620e2b5273a.webp?t=1732898183\" width=223 height=36 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Customize</strong>: Tailor your investigation experience by personalizing your character to your liking.<br></li><li><strong>Choose</strong>: Select your preferred map and difficulty level, ranging from beginner-friendly homes to harrowing professional settings like the eerie hospital.<br></li><li><strong>Immerse</strong>: Immerse yourself with our maps, tailored to your experience.<br></li><li><strong>Equip</strong>: Arm yourself with essential yet time-tested equipment to aid in your paranormal pursuits.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/928439a2f3525d30f22de3034e26ecad.webp?t=1732898183\" width=210 height=36 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Single-player</strong>: Play by yourself and to your own accord with a more challenging experience.<br></li><li><strong>Co-op</strong>: Cooperate with your friends or new investigators, for the best horror experience.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879360/extras/ca78f1a5fd0fbb2bef6de9a7d4c924d7.webp?t=1732898183\" width=211 height=36 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Beware!</strong> Entities are keen listeners and great care should be taken with every word.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Phear is a psychological horror game tailored for up to 4 players in online co-op. Tasked with investigating perilous locations, you and your team must find clues about the haunting entity, navigating the chilling and atmospheric locales together.",
